In one of my last ascensions on NAO I was sorely in need of a means to
confuse myself (I was a barbarian and learned my first spell late so I
wasn't forgetting it, and didn't have the usual assortment of potions
to help out, I probably needed holy water and dunked them all).  I
started collecting eggs in anticipation for the foo-proofing or armor
processed.  Rotten eggs are great ways to confuse yourself (without
also stun).  Just make sure they aren't one certain kind of egg (soft
boiled, those are nasty).  I've started always carrying two or three
rotten eggs around instead of two or three heavier potions of booze.



